name: The Pilgrimage

foundation: the-author upright
challenge: the-world-tree reversed
past: the-lamp reversed
future: the-harlequin upright
outcome: the-beacon upright

--- reading
A guiding hand, or gilded chain, draws you ever forward into worlds beyond imagination. Your fate is a heavy yoke to bear, but a glorious responsibility is not necessarily an unbreakable prison. What was once many independent threads, each strewn about their own paths, has been twisted into a sturdy rope. You are stronger than you were, but more reliant on others than ever. You twist onward through a murky path, hidden intentions and false trails threatening to divert you from your intended course. Seeking answers just asks more questions, and opposing tides threaten to tear you apart. Your rope is just one of many, and soon you may need to choose a direction in which to pull. Should you see your goals met, a divine choice awaits you. Will you be strong enough to make a decision, or will you abdicate to your betters?
---
